tyle=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;new «planned»&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Nhân&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.84&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Auth &amp; Accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;UC01–UC03, UC06&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;kept — refreshed against code&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.85&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.85&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Evidence&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;UC45, UC47, UC48&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;modified for v1.4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.86&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.86&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Alerts, Portfolio &amp; Admin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;UC16, UC19, UC20, UC42, UC43&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;modified for v1.4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.87&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.87&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Cross-cutting infrastructure&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;modified for v1.4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;Khôi / Thiện&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 8px&quot;&gt;4.88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="1480" height="357" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; (every Class Diagram, Figure 4.71–4.87) — «controller» HTTP entry (boundary) · «service» application logic (control) · «interface» port · «adapter» implementation · «entity» EF Core entity (table or view), with the ERD entity name when it differs · «background job» hosted service · «record» request / result type. Attributes are fields or injected dependencies; operations are the public API and the private steps shown in the Sequence Diagrams.&lt;br&gt;Dashed open arrow = dependency (injected or used) · solid line with multiplicities = association · filled diamond on the whole = composition · dashed hollow triangle = realization · solid hollow triangle = generalization.&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed class, grey italic member or grey dashed line = «planned» (Register v1.4, not on develop @ 420a379) · orange italic = value allowed by the database but not written by code. Parts removed in v1.4 are listed only in the Notes.&lt;br&gt;Large groups are split into parts &quot;(k/N)&quot; with the same figure number so that each part stays readable when printed on A4; a box with a light grey border that shows only the name (&quot;full class: part k/N&quot;) is a class drawn in full on that part of the same figure." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="433" width="1480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Index of figures (2 of 2)" id="Index_of_figures__2_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Class Diagrams – notes on Figures 4.71–4.87 (page 2 of 2) — removed classes, conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1480" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 17 feature groups on 37 pages: 2 kept (refreshed against code), 12 modified for Register v1.4, 3 new «planned»; 2 groups of the v2.0 set removed (Catalog, Offtake).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Removed in v1.4 (still in code)&lt;/b&gt; — classes not drawn any more; the code on develop @ 420a379 still has them:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Catalog module (UC24 listings, UC25 store) (v2.0 Figure 4.81): ListingsController, OperatorListingsController, AdminListingsController, CatalogService, PriceAnomaly, ListingModerationService, LowStockMonitor, LowStockOptions; ProductListing, PriceHistory, PriceCheck.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Offtake module (UC13 commitment, UC23 claim window of PR #72) (v2.0 Figure 4.84): OfftakeController, OfftakeService, OfftakeDepositHandler (and the unmerged OfftakeClaimService, OfftakeWindowService, OfftakeWindowJob, OfftakePaymentHandler); OfftakeCommitment, BatchOfftakePrice (VBatchCommitmentCap stays: the pre-order cap reads it, page Orders – pre-order &amp; deposit).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Crab tags and tag trace (UC46, UC33 by tag) (part of v2.0 Figure 4.80): TagsController, TagsService, IHarvestTagCodeGenerator / HarvestTagCodeGenerator, TraceService.GetAsync(tag); CrabTag, TagScan, v_traceability; HarvestRecord.TagId / TagCode / TagStatus.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Cart and retail checkout (UC26) (part of v2.0 Figure 4.82): OrdersController, OrderService, OrderPaymentHandler, OrderLine, StockReservation, StockRelease; PreorderBalanceJob / PreorderBalanceService (balance at harvest); PlacePreorderRequest.ListingId.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Packing by tag scan (part of v2.0 Figure 4.83): OrderPackingService.PackAsync(orderNo, tagCodes), ExtractTagCode; CrabItem.OrderLineId.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Low-stock alerts (part of v2.0 Figure 4.87 / 4.88): IAlertRaiser, AlertServiceRaiser, AlertType.LowStock.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;– Water-quality thresholds (UC17) (part of v2.0 Figure 4.79): ProductionThresholdVersion; ProductionLogsController.Thresholds / Configure; ProductionLogService.ThresholdsAsync / ConfigureAsync / Violations; ProductionLog.Ph / WaterTempC / SalinityPpt / ThresholdVersionId; AlertType.WaterQuality.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026, confirmed by the lead: Batch opening condition (FundingCloseService), box rows (BoxRow, RowAllocation Held · Allocated · Released), deposit cases with UC55 Cancel Bulk Pre-order (DepositForfeitService, OrderCancellationService), survival rate and the Standard Cost of funded boxes (SettlementService), InvoicedSale (SalesOrder.OrderType, SaleReason, RevenueLine type); PreOrderQuota, PreOrderHold and Batch.SalesWindowDays «planned». Every page that applies them carries the line &quot;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&quot;&lt;br&gt;• «planned» = required by Register v1.4 but not in the code yet: grey dashed class, grey italic attribute or operation, grey dashed line. Orange italic = value allowed by the database but not written by code. The physical ERD and the database script stay on the code (V001–V017).&lt;br&gt;• Every lifeline class and every message of the Sequence Diagrams (Figure 4.36–4.70) is a class and an operation here, including the EF Core operations of AppDbContext (checked when the generator runs). The Was column and every &quot;v2.0 Figure&quot; reference keep the old v2.0 numbers." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="1480" height="328" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Funding (1 of 3)" id="Funding__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«controller»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;FundingController&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=44;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="96" width="340" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="- funding: FundingService" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=1;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=11;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;vertic