tml=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="880" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC09–UC12, funding close · owner: Thiện · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;Money never passes through CrabShare: the VietQR pays into the batch account at the intermediary and the webhook confirms it (Payments). Reservation lasts Funding:ReservationMinutes = 30 (appsettings.json), capped at the funding deadline. v1.4: investors reserve whole box rows; amount = Σ (boxes of the row × Standard Cost per box), the minimum contribution is one row; RowAllocation is Held during the reservation, Allocated when the contribution is Confirmed and Released when it expires or is refunded; at most one Held or Allocated allocation per BoxRow, and BoxRow has no status of its own (a row is taken when such an allocation exists). A Batch opens when the minimum viable capital and the minimum pre-order ratio are reached; only the boxes of funded rows are stocked. Otherwise investors and every depositing Customer are refunded and pending deposit QRs are cancelled (FundingCloseService «planned» steps).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="96" width="340" height="279" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Contracts (1 of 2)" id="Contracts__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&