on develop @ 420a379 · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.75 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="880" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC12, UC18, UC40 · owner: Thiện · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;Idempotency (TL-10): ProviderTxnId is UNIQUE; a repeated webhook is answered 200 without a second booking; payouts carry the reference CHI{id}. Invoiced orders reuse the existing purpose OrderPayment (as in the Logical ERD), handled by InvoicedSalePaymentHandler «planned». Removed in v1.4 (still in code): the retail OrderPaymentHandler and OfftakeDepositHandler, purposes OfftakeDeposit / OfftakePayment, PaymentTarget.ForOfftake and PaymentRequest.OfftakeId; PaymentRequestService.CreateForOrderAsync has no caller.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="96" width="340" height="189" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Settlement (1 of 2)" id="Settlement__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«controller»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;AdminSettlementsController&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=44;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax