 UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="26"><mxGeometry x="0.8633" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.75 (2/2) – Class Diagram: Operators and Boxes modules — operator application, numbered boxes and box rows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379 · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.77 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="880" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC04, UC05, UC44 · owner: Viên · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;Operator.Status = Approved is the precondition for every write in Boxes, Batches, Production, Harvest and Evidence; the box count is capped at ApprovedSlotCapacity. v1.4: boxes carry their farm row (PhysicalSlot.RowCode, V001); the rows chosen for a Batch become BoxRow «planned» (UC07). Farm coordinates for the map and the delivery radius are «planned». ERD names: PhysicalSlot = Box, SlotAllocation = BoxAllocation, AppUser = User.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="96" width="340" height="159" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Batches (1 of 3)" id="Batches__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id