.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="459" y="346"/><mxPoint x="459" y="967"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="51" value="0..1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="50"><mxGeometry x="-0.9230" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="52" value="*" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="50"><mxGeometry x="0.9230" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="53" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.76 (3/3) – Class Diagram: Batches module — Batch by box rows, Standard Cost lock with price per kg and floor price, remuneration tiers, farm map&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379 · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.78 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1300" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="54" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC07, UC08, UC09, UC25 · owner: Viên · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;The Standard Cost is locked when the Batch is approved (TL-11; triggers make the Locked version immutable) — in v1.4 together with the price per kg and the floor price «planned». The Operator types the price per kg with the UC49 range in view. Removed in v1.4 (still in code): BatchOfftakePrice and the per-grade offtake prices (SyncOfftakePricesAsync, OfftakePricesAsync, LoadOfftakePricesAsync), Batch.OfftakePreorderCapPct and FrozenStockCapMonths. ERD name: StandardCostTranchePlan = TranchePlan.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="96" width="340" height="189" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Production (1 of 2)" id="Production__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«controller»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;StockingController&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=44;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="96" width="340" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="- stocking: StockingService" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=1;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=11;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=-1;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;rotatable=0;labelPosition=right;points=[];portConstraint=eastwest;strokeColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x