delivery order gets one QR when the Operator prepares the delivery note (OrderQrCode «planned»); the trace follows CrabItem.OrderId «planned» (as in the Logical ERD). Traceability is still pending confirmation by Viên and Nhân. Removed in v1.4 (still in code): TagsController, TagsService, IHarvestTagCodeGenerator, CrabTag, TagScan, v_traceability, TraceService.GetAsync(tag), HarvestRecord tag columns and the CatalogService.SyncHarvestStockAsync call. ERD names: HarvestStartRequestLog = HarvestStartRequest, CrabItem = Crab." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="96" width="340" height="189" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Pricing module" id="Pricing_module"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«controller» «planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;PriceSuggestionsController&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=44;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#f8fafc;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="96" width="340" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="- prices: PriceSuggestionService" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft