connectable="0" parent="48"><mxGeometry x="0.7959" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="51" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.3123;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2706;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c38"><mxGeometry x="-0.1144" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="431" y="191"/><mxPoint x="431" y="306"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="52" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="51"><mxGeometry x="-0.7549" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="53" value="0..1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#64748b;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="51"><mxGeometry x="0.7549" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="54" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.81 (2/2) – Class Diagram: Orders module, part 1 — bulk pre-order with deposit, tracking, deposit timeout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379 · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.82 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1300" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="55" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC27, UC28, UC55 · owner: Nhân · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;v1.4: Customers (restaurants, small traders) — and Investors, except the Operator of the Batch and related parties — pre-order only while the Batch is funding, by number of crabs (or kg) from a minimum quantity, and pay a VietQR deposit; no overselling (Batch row locked, cap re-checked after the insert). UC28 Track Order Status = OrderTrackingController.List / Get → OrderQueryService (read only). Removed in v1.4 (still in code): OrderLine (listing line; the Logical ERD drops it), PlacePreorderRequest.ListingId, OrdersController.Checkout, OrderService, OrderPaymentHandler, StockReservation / StockRelease, PreorderBalanceJob / PreorderBalanceService. VBatchCommitmentCap is kept for the pre-order cap in kg (code); its offtake part is removed in v1.4. The crab quota and the 15-minute holds (Orders:ReservationMinutes) are PreOrderQuota (batch_preorder_quota) and PreOrderHold (preorder_hold), «planned»; HeldCrabCount + DepositedCrabCount ≤ MaxCrabCount (no overselling); a hold is Active until ExpiresAt, Deposited when the deposit is paid and Released when the QR expires (cancelling then costs nothing, UC55). ERD name: CustomerAddress = DeliveryAddress.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="96" width="340" height="339" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Orders – delivery &amp; disputes (1 of 2)" id="Orders___delivery__amp__disputes__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0