evelop @ 420a379 · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.83 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1300" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="100" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC29–UC32, UC34 · owner: Nhân · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;v1.4: the money is the weighed kg at delivery × the price per kg fixed in advance (delivery included); dead or spoiled crabs in transit are not charged; the Customer pays the balance by VietQR on delivery. The order QR is issued when the Operator prepares the delivery note (AssignBoxesAsync) and the boxes are linked by CrabItem.OrderId «planned». UC34 Rate Order works on Completed orders only (OrderRatingService). Vehicle dispatch is out of scope. Removed in v1.4 (still in code): OrderPackingService.PackAsync(orderNo, tagCodes) and ExtractTagCode; per-listing &quot;#ITEMS:&quot; ratings; CrabItem.OrderLineId.&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="888" width="1280" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Orders – invoiced &amp; final (1 of 2)" id="Orders___invoiced__amp__final__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«controller» «planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;InvoicedSalesCo