&lt;i&gt;+ MediaType: string — Invoice (not written by code)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=1;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=11;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="c5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;+ Source: string — DocumentUpload (not written by code)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=1;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=11;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="c5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="64" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«entity»&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;SalesOrder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;full class: part 1/2&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="344" width="340" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="" style="html=1;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="445" y="141"/><mxPoint x="445" y="364"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="9"><mxGeometry x="-0.8300" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="*" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="9"><mxGeometry x="0.8300" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.83 (2/2) – Class Diagram: Orders module, part 3 «planned» — invoiced sales (low-grade, forfeit resale), final order at floor price, forfeited deposits (UC54)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379 · new «planned» · new for Register v1.4 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="880" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC50, UC51, UC54, UC55 · owner: Nhân · new «planned»&lt;br&gt;UC50 Record Invoiced Sale / UC51 / UC54 / UC55 (TP3). One InvoicedSale order type with saleReason LowGrade (weak, watery, frozen crabs sold cheaper) or ForfeitResale (crabs released by a forfeited order, UC54 case c); every delivered order has one Invoice. A deposit is forfeited when the Customer cancels after paying and the Batch opens (a) or refuses the delivery / does not pay the balance (c); it is refunded when the Batch does not open (b); cancelling before paying costs nothing (d); leftover stock goes to the committed buyer through one invoiced final order, never below the floor price published before funding (the platform does not guarantee it). Invoiced orders reuse the payment purpose OrderPayment. All four sources feed settlement (RevenueLine type DeliveredOrder | InvoicedSale | ForfeitedDeposit | FinalOrder). Attribute names follow the Logical ERD. Replaces the v2.0 Offtake page (removed in v1.4, still in code).&lt;br&gt;Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="96" width="340" height="279" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Auth &amp; Accounts (1 of 3)" id="Auth__amp__Accounts__1_of_3_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«controller»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;AuthController&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=44;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#1e293b;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fillColor=#e0f2fe;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="96" width="340" height="158" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="- auth: AuthService" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=1;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=11;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="- me: ICurrentUse