0" y="118" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="+ IsDefault: bool" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=1;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=11;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="c23"><mxGeometry x="0" y="138" width="340" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.84 (3/3) – Class Diagram: Auth and Accounts modules — registration, login, eKYC, payout account protection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379 · kept — refreshed against code · was v2.0 Figure 4.85 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1300" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC01–UC03, UC06 · owner: Khôi · kept — refreshed against code&lt;br&gt;JwtBearer OnTokenValidated reloads AppUser.Status and roles on every request, so a lock takes effect at once. eKYC stores only the result (TL-06). Accounts write audit rows on the same hash chain as IAuditLog. v1.4: the Customer role is a bulk buyer (restaurant, small trader); the Evidence Reviewer is a separate permission of a Platform Administrator. ERD names: AppUser = User, AppUserRole = UserRole, KycCheck = IdentityCheck, CustomerAddress = DeliveryAddress." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="96" width="340" height="159" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Evidence (1 of 3)" 