fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="14"><mxGeometry x="0.7917" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset" x="0" y="-3"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.85 (3/3) – Class Diagram: Evidence module — live capture, crab detection module port, risk score, review, explanation, capture requests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5 · classes as on develop @ 420a379 · modified for v1.4 · was v2.0 Figure 4.86 · legend: Index page&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="880" height="61" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; · use cases: UC45, UC47, UC48 · owner: Khôi · modified for v1.4&lt;br&gt;The crab detection module only checks whether a crab is present in the box photo. It sits behind the replaceable ICrabDetector port and its weight in the risk score is capped (≤ 15), so detection never rejects evidence alone; a risk score routes doubtful evidence to the human Evidence Reviewer. develop @ 420a379 wires NoopCrabDetector (no conclusion); the trained module is «planned». Removed in v1.4 (still in code): the tagCode path of UploadAsync and Evidence.CrabItemId (V017) used for tag activation. ERD name: EvidenceDetection = CrabDetection." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="96" width="340" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Alerts, Portfolio &amp; Admin (1 of 2)" id="Alerts__Portfolio__amp__Admin__1_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" conne